      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Artifact Enhancer enchants the equipment obtained in Infinite Space."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "When enchanting, you choose one category (Physical, Magic or Ranged), and one of the options in that category is given at random."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Enchanting Is Safe",
      "text": "The enchant itself never fails or destroys the equipment. Resetting the enchants, however, can destroy it."
    },
